te anything."}],[["$","section","Why your photo library is full of duplicates",{"className":"seo-page__section","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Why your photo library is full of duplicates"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Every time you import photos from a phone, sync with a cloud service, or copy a folder for safekeeping, you risk creating identical copies. A typical Windows photo library can have hundreds of duplicate images taking up gigabytes — without any of them showing up as obvious duplicates in Windows Explorer."}]]}],"$L4"],"$L5","$L6","$L7"]}]}]],null,"$L8"]}],{},null,false]},null,false]},null,false],"$L9",false]],"m":"$undefined","G":["$a",[]],"s":false,"S":true}
